@startuml
agent -> controller: connect to and give type url to listen with its own info and resources it may already have
controller -> agent: reply back with a list of resources that should be added/update or deleted with the id of the request (nonce)
agent -> controller: reply back with the id request to say it has received the list
loop until controller or agent stop
  controller -> agent: send resource added/delete/updated with the id of the request (nonce)
  agent -> controller: reply back with the id request to say it has received the resource
end
@enduml
